## What the agent must NEVER do

1. Use `FROM mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:*` in the final image.
2. Use `root` as runtime user.
3. Copy all source code before `restore` (breaks cache).
4. Use `CMD dotnet Api.dll` (shell form) — always use exec form.
5. Omit `HEALTHCHECK`.
6. Pass connection strings or tokens as `ARG` or `ENV` in Dockerfile.
7. Use `latest` as base image tag in production.
8. Omit `.dockerignore` or leave it incomplete.
9. Do `COPY . .` without first copying and restoring `.csproj` files separately.
10. Create more than one `EXPOSE` port without justification.
